  "setup": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "the players",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_points"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hands_won",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_hands_won"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat 1 is player A and seat 2 is player B. Both start with {starting_points} points and {starting_hands_won} hands won."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "label": "the table",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "points",
        "hands_won"
      ],
      "text": "You start with:"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "clear the table",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck + players[0].hand + players[1].hand + [p.face_up for p in players if p.face_up > 0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "play",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "face_up",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "play_code",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stake",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "folded",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "caller_call",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "responder_answer",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "caller_answer",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_winner",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "cards_shown",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "plays_shown",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "caller_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if int(hand_number / 2) * 2 != hand_number else 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "responder_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "2 if caller_seat == 1 else 1"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "the deal",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[int(uniform(0, len(deck)))]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[int(uniform(0, len(deck)))]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[int(uniform(0, len(deck)))]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[int(uniform(0, len(deck)))]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "face_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[int(uniform(0, len(deck)))]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[int(uniform(0, len(deck)))]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[int(uniform(0, len(deck)))]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[int(uniform(0, len(deck)))]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "face_up",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[a * 1000000 + b * 1000 + c for a in you.hand + [you.face_up] for b in you.hand + [you.face_up] for c in you.hand + [you.face_up] if a != b and a != c and b != c]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "the hand begins",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Hand {hand_number} of {hands_total}. Seat {caller_seat} is the Caller and seat {responder_seat} is the Responder. Face-up cards: seat 1 {players[0].face_up}, seat 2 {players[1].face_up}."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "your cards",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "hand",
        "face_up",
        "points",
        "hands_won"
      ],
      "text": "Your cards and the standings:"
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "calls",
      "label": "caller's call",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == caller_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "PUT",
          "PASS"
        ]
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "caller_call",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "resp_options",
              "value": {
                "calc": "['SEE', 'FOLD', 'RE-PUT'] if $answer == 'PUT' else ['PUT', 'PASS']"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "The Caller (seat {seat}) says {value}."
      },
      "text": "You are the Caller in hand {hand_number}. Say PUT or PASS. After PUT the Responder may SEE (stake {stake_put_see}, play follows), FOLD (you score {fold_to_put_points} point and win the hand, no play) or RE-PUT (you must answer SEE or FOLD). After PASS the Responder may PASS (stake {stake_pass_pass}, play follows) or PUT (you must answer SEE or FOLD)."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "calls",
      "label": "responder's answer",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == responder_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "game": "resp_options"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "responder_answer",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "The Responder (seat {seat}) says {value}."
      },
      "text": "You are the Responder. The Caller said {caller_call}. After PUT: SEE (stake {stake_put_see}, play follows), FOLD (Caller scores {fold_to_put_points} point and wins the hand, no play) or RE-PUT (Caller must answer SEE for stake {stake_reput_see}, or FOLD and give you {fold_to_reput_points} points and the hand). After PASS: PASS (stake {stake_pass_pass}, play follows) or PUT (Caller must answer SEE for stake {stake_pass_put_see}, or FOLD and give you {fold_to_put_after_pass_points} point and the hand)."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "calls",
      "label": "the responder's answer settles",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stake",
            "value": {
              "calc": "stake_put_see"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "caller_call == 'PUT' and responder_answer == 'SEE'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "caller_seat"
            },
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "fold_to_put_points"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "caller_call == 'PUT' and responder_answer == 'FOLD'"
            },
            "text": "The Responder folds. Seat {player} scores and wins the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "caller_seat"
            },
            "key": "hands_won",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "caller_call == 'PUT' and responder_answer == 'FOLD'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "caller_seat"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "caller_call == 'PUT' and responder_answer == 'FOLD'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "folded",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "caller_call == 'PUT' and responder_answer == 'FOLD'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stake",
            "value": {
              "calc": "stake_pass_pass"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "caller_call == 'PASS' and responder_answer == 'PASS'"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "calls",
      "label": "caller's answer",
      "when": {
        "calc": "responder_answer in ['RE-PUT', 'PUT']"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == caller_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "SEE",
          "FOLD"
        ]
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "caller_answer",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "The Caller (seat {seat}) answers {value}."
      },
      "text": "The Responder said {responder_answer}. Say SEE or FOLD. After a RE-PUT: SEE makes the stake {stake_reput_see} and play follows; FOLD gives the Responder {fold_to_reput_points} points and the hand, no play. After PASS then PUT: SEE makes the stake {stake_pass_put_see} and play follows; FOLD gives the Responder {fold_to_put_after_pass_points} point and the hand, no play."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "calls",
      "label": "the caller's answer settles",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stake",
            "value": {
              "calc": "stake_reput_see"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "responder_answer == 'RE-PUT' and caller_answer == 'SEE'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "responder_seat"
            },
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "fold_to_reput_points"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "responder_answer == 'RE-PUT' and caller_answer == 'FOLD'"
            },
            "text": "The Caller folds to the RE-PUT. Seat {player} scores and wins the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stake",
            "value": {
              "calc": "stake_pass_put_see"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "responder_answer == 'PUT' and caller_answer == 'SEE'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "responder_seat"
            },
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "fold_to_put_after_pass_points"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "responder_answer == 'PUT' and caller_answer == 'FOLD'"
            },
            "text": "The Caller folds to the PUT. Seat {player} scores and wins the hand."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "responder_seat"
            },
            "key": "hands_won",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "responder_answer in ['RE-PUT', 'PUT'] and caller_answer == 'FOLD'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "responder_seat"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "responder_answer in ['RE-PUT', 'PUT'] and caller_answer == 'FOLD'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "folded",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "responder_answer in ['RE-PUT', 'PUT'] and caller_answer == 'FOLD'"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "play",
      "label": "play",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not folded"
      },
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "store": "play_code",
      "text": "The stake is {stake}. Choose an ordered list of 3 different cards from your 4 (your hand plus your face-up card). Each option is one number: the last three digits are your 3rd card, the three before them your 2nd card, and the digits before those your 1st card (for example 134092051 means 134, then 92, then 51). A card's code is strength*10+suit. Your opponent chooses at the same moment and sees nothing until both lists are in."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "play",
      "label": "the tricks",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not folded"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "play",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[int(int(you.play_code) / 1000000), int(int(you.play_code) / 1000) - int(int(you.play_code) / 1000000) * 1000, int(you.play_code) - int(int(you.play_code) / 1000) * 1000]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "tricks_won",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(int(you.play[i] / 10) > int(players[2 - you.seat].play[i] / 10) for i in [0, 1, 2])"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "play",
      "label": "score the hand",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "not folded and you.tricks_won >= tricks_to_win_hand"
            },
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "stake"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} wins the hand on tricks and scores the stake."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "not folded and you.tricks_won >= tricks_to_win_hand"
            },
            "key": "hands_won",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.seat for p in players if p.tricks_won >= tricks_to_win_hand] + [0])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "not folded"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "cards_shown",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.hand + [p.face_up] for p in players]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "plays_shown",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.play for p in players]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "reveal",
      "label": "the hand is shown",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Hand {hand_number} is over. Calls: Caller {caller_call}; Responder {responder_answer}; Caller's answer {caller_answer}. All 8 cards [seat 1 hand and face-up, seat 2 hand and face-up]: {cards_shown}. Plays [seat 1, seat 2] (empty if a fold ended the hand): {plays_shown}. Tricks won: seat 1 {players[0].tricks_won}, seat 2 {players[1].tricks_won}. Hand won by seat {hand_winner} (0 means nobody scored). Points: seat 1 {players[0].points}, seat 2 {players[1].points}. Hands won: seat 1 {players[0].hands_won}, seat 2 {players[1].hands_won}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "reveal",
      "label": "next hand",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "hand_number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "reveal",
      "label": "after the last hand",
      "when": {
        "calc": "hand_number > hands_total"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "hand_number > hands_total"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.points * 1000 + you.hands_won",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final points: Seat 1 {players[0].points}, Seat 2 {players[1].points}; hands won: Seat 1 {players[0].hands_won}, Seat 2 {players[1].hands_won}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 40,
    "rounds_max": 40,
    "actions_max": 1000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "CARDS. A standard 52-card deck; suits do not matter. Strengths: 3 = {strength_3}, 2 = {strength_2}, A = {strength_A}, K = {strength_K}, Q = {strength_Q}, J = {strength_J}, 10 = {strength_10}, 9 = {strength_9}, 8 = {strength_8}, 7 = {strength_7}, 6 = {strength_6}, 5 = {strength_5}, 4 = {strength_4}. Higher strength is better. A card is shown as a code strength*10+suit (suit 1 to {suits}), e.g. 134 is a 3 (strength 13).\n\nSETUP. Seat 1 is player A, seat 2 is player B. Each starts with {starting_points} points and {starting_hands_won} hands won. The match lasts exactly {hands_total} hands. In odd-numbered hands A is the Caller and B the Responder; in even-numbered hands B is the Caller and A the Responder.\n\nEACH HAND:\n1. Deal. All {deck_size} cards are shuffled and each player gets {cards_dealt_per_player} cards: {private_cards_per_player} private cards and {face_up_cards_per_player} face-up card announced to both players.\n2. Caller's call. The Caller says PUT or PASS.\n3. Responder's answer. If the Caller said PUT, the Responder says SEE, FOLD or RE-PUT. On SEE, the stake is {stake_put_see} and play follows. On FOLD, the Caller scores {fold_to_put_points} point and wins the hand, and there is no play. On RE-PUT, go to step 4. If the Caller said PASS, the Responder says PUT or PASS. On PASS, the stake is {stake_pass_pass} and play follows. On PUT, go to step 4.\n4. Caller's answer (only after a RE-PUT or PUT). The Caller says SEE or FOLD. After a RE-PUT: SEE makes the stake {stake_reput_see} and play follows; FOLD gives the Responder {fold_to_reput_points} points and the hand. After a PUT that followed the Caller's PASS: SEE makes the stake {stake_pass_put_see} and play follows; FOLD gives the Responder {fold_to_put_after_pass_points} point and the hand. A FOLD ends the hand without play.\n5. Play (simultaneous). Each player secretly chooses an ordered list of {cards_played} different cards from their own 4 cards. The face-up card may be used or left out. The lists are then revealed.\n6. Tricks. The 1st cards of the two lists are compared, then the 2nd, then the 3rd. In each pair the higher strength wins that trick; equal strength ties the trick and it belongs to no one.\n7. Score. A player who won at least {tricks_to_win_hand} of the {tricks_per_hand} tricks scores the stake (1, 2 or 4) and wins the hand. Otherwise (one trick each with a tie, one win and two ties, or three ties) nobody scores.\n8. Announce. All calls, all 8 cards (including any card left out), the hand result, and both players' points and hands won are announced.\n\nEND. After hand {hands_total} the match ends. The player with more points wins. If points are equal, the player with more hands won wins (a hand is won by scoring it on tricks or by the opponent folding). If both are equal, the match is a draw and the players share the result."
}
